==Rules==
{{StageRule|Summer}}

==Battleground==
*The enemy base here is a [[Gavel Base (Enemy Base)|Gavel Base]].
*4 [[Snache]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*4 [[Croco]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*1 [[Teacher Bear]] spawns after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*1 [[Mooth]] spawns after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[The Face]] spawns as the boss.
**7 [[Pigge]]s spawn, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
**4 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
**2 [[Mooth]]s spawn, delay 60~63.33 seconds<sup>1,800f~1,900f</sup>.
**3 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
**2 [[Teacher Bear]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 46.67~50 seconds<sup>1,400f~1,500f</sup>.
**7 [[Golden Doge]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
**5 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
**3 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
An easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

